                <head>[Untitled]</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Colon</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1903-11-05T21:41:00-05:19"><hi rendition="#italic">November 5,
                                1903—9.41 p.m</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Secretary of the Navy</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Washington, D. C.:</hi></p>
                <p>British man-of-war <hi rendition="#italic">Amphion</hi> is protecting American
                    interests at Panama. Reported bombardment much exaggerated.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hubbard.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
